{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12243050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12243050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1224305001:1":{"text":"みんな！誰が戻ってきたと思う！？","source_cn":"各位，看看谁回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E417CBAC8D6EFB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224305002:0":{"text":"シンドバッド、今回はずいぶん遅かったじゃないか。","source_cn":"辛巴达，你这孩子，这么久才回来一趟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DC02548CF9C41E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1224305003:1":{"text":"それに恩人さんたちまで。えっと、そちらの方は……","source_cn":"恩人<male>先生</male><female>小姐...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF6FA59079302505","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"それに恩人さんたちまで。えっと、そちらの方は……","female":"それに恩人さんたちまで。えっと、そちらの方は……","variant_male_record_index":"139364","variant_female_record_index":"139365","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224305004:1":{"text":"……私よ、ベラ。","source_cn":"……是我，贝拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0340D6EC37AE4A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224305005:1":{"text":"ベラ……本当にあんたなのかい！？あたしがおかしくなっちまったんじゃないよね……","source_cn":"贝拉……真是你！我还以为是自己认错了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95E530A6A78A6428","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224305006:1":{"text":"ブラッディ・マリーが、アクアラ村に何の用よ。","source_cn":"你一个血薇帮，来小水村做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C457E685DF85B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1224305007:1":{"text":"船のメンテナンスに人手が必要で、皆さんの力を貸してほしいの。","source_cn":"血薇帮想请你们帮忙，维护出航的船只。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B2898477DAE919A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224305008:0":{"text":"どの口が言ってんだか。絶対に無理！今すぐに帰って！","source_cn":"别浪费口舌了，我告诉你，没门！你走吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94C9EF88FC962D92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1224305009:1":{"text":"ブラッディ・マリーはラスティーアンカーの貿易業を再開するために、埠頭の再建を行ってるところなの。","source_cn":"血薇帮正在重建码头，目的是恢复锈锚港的贸易货运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC002F3F724F20D90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1224305010:1":{"text":"よく考えてみて、これは皆さんのためにもなるはずよ。","source_cn":"这是对大家都好的事，你们应该好好考虑一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49F73097236EA4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1224305011:1":{"text":"過去はもう過ぎ去ったこと。いつまでも個人的な恨みに囚われて……","source_cn":"以前的事都过去了，你们不要受私人恩怨影响——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AFE2DBAA3604206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1224305012:0":{"text":"うるさい！！","source_cn":"——闭嘴！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A6D72DB33271D04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1224305013:0":{"text":"前にも言ったけど、アタイたちがブラッディ・マリーのために何かをすることは絶対にない！","source_cn":"我早就说过，我们绝对不可能帮血薇帮做事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FCDD048193C6D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1224305014:0":{"text":"たとえテシオが投獄され、裁判にかけられても、この事実は変わらない！もう諦めな！","source_cn":"即使泰西欧被拉下马，即使他被关押、被审判，这件事也不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8786B51B40119AE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1224305015:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1224305016:1":{"text":"はぁ……ターシャの言葉は少し厳しいけど、これは事実。帰ってくれるかい？","source_cn":"唉……塔莎的话是难听了点，但理是这个理。你回去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89058B10875C1450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1224305017:0":{"text":"村人の方たちが……ここまではっきりと拒絶するなんて。","source_cn":"村民们……拒绝得也太干脆了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD715E608E770C4ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1224305018:1":{"text":"でも、私だけでしょうか？ベラさんに対する態度に違和感を感じているのは……","source_cn":"是我的错觉吗？大家对贝拉的态度好像有点奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4E8A443E706CAB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1224305018":{"text":"でも、私だけでしょうか？ベラさんに対する態度に違和感を感じているのは……","source_cn":"是我的错觉吗？大家对贝拉的态度好像有点奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4E8A443E706CAB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1224305019:1":{"text":"はい。シンドバッドさんも、長年の付き合いとか言ってましたよね。","source_cn":"唔，辛巴达也说过，他认识贝拉很多年了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5E824CEC803D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1224305020:1":{"text":"ロンロンの予想では、きっと彼女たちは顔見知りなのです！","source_cn":"满满猜，他们肯定认识！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB50B39B3C1168E5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1224305021:1":{"text":"……明らかにそれ以上の何かがあるでしょ。","source_cn":"肯定不仅是认识这么简单啦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F347A205381EC91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1224305022:0":{"text":"一つ提案があるの……","source_cn":"……我还有一个提议。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66734BED570B3783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1224305023:1":{"text":"聞きたくない！早く帰ってくれ！","source_cn":"不想听！你走吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0873BB54236DCCC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1224305024:1":{"text":"テシオの裁判を交換条件とするならどう？","source_cn":"如果以泰西欧的审判作为交换条件呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6EB6FF3208B7666","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1224305025:1":{"text":"……どういう意味よ？","source_cn":"……你什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE4EB628E8D3FCA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1224305026:1":{"text":"ユーリおじさんの船団が殺害された件、皆さんが裁判で証言できるように手配する。直接が嫌なら、事前に議事堂で証言を残してもいい。","source_cn":"泰西欧即将被审判，你们可以出庭作证，也可以提前到议事厅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9177A23F4199C311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1224305027:1":{"text":"私もユーリおじさんたちの名誉を取り戻すよう、ボスや若頭に働きかける。","source_cn":"我也会请老大和二当家做主，给尤里叔叔他们正名。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D879541392DDA36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1224305028:1":{"text":"ユーリおじさんたちの冤罪が認められれば……皆さんが非難されることもなくなるでしょ。","source_cn":"……这样的话，尤里叔叔他们就能洗刷冤屈，你们也不会再被骂了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91A014C40DA7DCAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1224305029:1":{"text":"言ったことに責任は持てるの？","source_cn":"你说话作数吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06934BD5E75E63DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1224305030:1":{"text":"私は今や、ルカ若頭の右腕よ。","source_cn":"我已经是二当家卢卡的副手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x608E3529BCAEBB75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1224305031:1":{"text":"……ア、アタイ一人で決めれるわけないでしょ。村のみんなと相談するから、そこで待ってなさい。","source_cn":"……我一个人不能做决定，要和村里的姐妹商量一下。你等着吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A4A395E3F8E868C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1224305032:1":{"text":"シンドバッド！アンタもおいで！","source_cn":"辛巴达，你也过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF498CF5CC24EC878","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:52:1224305033:0":{"text":"アクアラ村の村人たちが一堂に会し、長い時間をかけて話し合った……","source_cn":"小水村的村民们聚在一起，商量了很久很久……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4119BBBB7153B0A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:0:1":{"text":"ああ、まるでベラのことを熟知しているようだな。","source_cn":"她们似乎和贝拉很熟悉","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x94D0D7FC1E90EBFE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"ああ、まるでベラのことを熟知しているようだな。","female":"ええ、まるでベラのことを熟知しているようね。","variant_male_record_index":"67368","variant_female_record_index":"67369","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:1:2":{"text":"確かにブラッディを憎んでるが、ベラを追い出したいわけではなさそうだな。","source_cn":"她们憎恶血薇帮，却没有把贝拉赶走","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x99668A9B07C5E809","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"確かにブラッディを憎んでるが、ベラを追い出したいわけではなさそうだな。","female":"確かにブラッディを憎んでるけど、ベラを追い出したいわけではなさそうね。","variant_male_record_index":"67370","variant_female_record_index":"67371","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"シンドバッド","source":"辛巴